      "writtenOn": "2026-02-19T10:59:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "IMHO, we should make this 16 bytes including the type, to avoid compressing it with the smccc return (see my comment below) we can rely on bit-fields in that case.\nFor example max arm64 IPA is 52 bits",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 865,
