      "writtenOn": "2026-02-19T11:16:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "But then it means we need to pack differently according to the type of request or __packed the whole thing and reduce and make the size args 32-bits.\n\nAlternatively, we could just say hyp_req_to_smccc() only works with types using the .mem argument.\n\nAnd I agree this would be less headache than trying to encode the type into a1.",
